== C. Conditioned Osc_(m,n)(F | |a|=s) with random-map null, smax = 42 ==
  'meas' is exact.  'null' is one draw of the random-map model with the same coarse law.
  atoms/cell = C(s-1,n-1)/3^n.  Below about 1 the law cannot be flat at any scale: the row has too few atoms.
  meas below null at fine scales means the true map spreads more evenly than a random map.
